# === Dart / pub workspace ===
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.packages
build/
**/doc/api/
# The single root pubspec.lock IS committed (reproducible workspace resolution); members have none.
packages/*/pubspec.lock

# === Rust ===
**/target/
# Cargo.lock IS committed (reproducible native builds for the shipped crate).

# === flutter_rust_bridge generated (KEPT, not ignored) ===
# packages/iroh_quic/lib/src/rust/** and rust/**/src/frb_generated.rs are committed so consumers
# need no codegen.

# === Vendored crate copy ===
# packages/iroh_flutter/rust is a COMMITTED mirror of packages/iroh_quic/rust (cargokit needs the
# crate co-located, and `dart pub publish` drops .gitignore'd files — so it must be tracked to ship
# in the plugin archive). Keep it current with `tool/sync_native.sh`; CI verifies it's in sync. Only
# its build output is ignored (covered by the `**/target/` rule above).

# === Flutter plugin + example: generated / machine-specific / native build outputs ===
